 Select your PORTAL in **Settings → Connections → Scan for Devices**. Advanced mode adds its raw EC and temperature readings to the shot graph and saved shot. EC is not a TDS measurement. Use **Forget** to remove the sensor.
 
+Save refractometer TDS in Shot Review or History to build an empirical estimate for the same coffee and mounting mode. The PORTAL panel in Settings shows **k**, reference shots, exclusions and prediction error, and updates after saved readings change. Shots with measurement warnings are excluded; fewer than five independent references or predictions outside the measured range remain uncertain. Use the same PORTAL and water; EC estimates do not replace refractometer measurements.
